TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water, exposed to O2(g)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water pH 7
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -volume 1
    O2(g) -0.7
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -totals Fe S Ca
    -si Goethite Gypsum Pyrite
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
